        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Flula Borg, Dirk Nowitzki, Alex Simmons, David Giuntoli, Leopold Hoesch\n- Works: Buddymoon, Nowitzki. The Perfect Shot\n- Organizations: Dallas Mavericks, National Basketball Association\n- Topics: film, comedy, music, YouTube, basketball\n\nFacts:\n- Flula Borg was born on March 28, 1982, and he is a German actor, comedian, musician, and YouTube personality.\n- Flula Borg is also known as DJ Flula or simply Flula, sometimes stylized as f|u|a.\n- Dirk Werner Nowitzki was born on June 19, 1978, and he is a German professional basketball player.\n- Dirk Nowitzki played for the Dallas Mavericks in the National Basketball Association.\n- Buddymoon, previously known as Honey Buddies, is a 2016 American independent comedy film.\n- Buddymoon was directed by Alex Simmons and written by Alex Simmons, Flula Borg, and David Giuntoli.\n- Buddymoon stars Flula Borg and David Giuntoli.\n- Nowitzki. The Perfect Shot is a German documentary film produced by Leopold Hoesch.\n- Nowitzki. The Perfect Shot concerns Dirk Nowitzki's career from the second German Basketball League to the NBA.",
